{"version":2,"slug":"the-full-trip-slow-english-vlog-for-beginner-english-learners-3","videoId":"c_p5IcSzp2k","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/c_p5IcSzp2k","lang":"en","title":"The Full Trip | Slow English Vlog for Beginner English Learners","category":"Vlog","channel":"A Day in Los Angeles","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Hello everyone. Welcome to a new episode"},{"start":4,"text":"of Beau's Slow English. In today's"},{"start":9,"text":"episode, we are going to go out and"},{"start":14,"text":"about, which means I'm going outside of"},{"start":17,"text":"my house and we are exploring Los"},{"start":21,"text":"Angeles on this beautiful sunny day. In"},{"start":26,"text":"case we haven't met yet, my name is"},{"start":30,"text":"Beau. Hello. Welcome to my channel. My"},{"start":35,"text":"goal is to help you to feel confident"},{"start":40,"text":"when learning English. Feel free to read"},{"start":45,"text":"the captions along as I speak the words"},{"start":51,"text":"or you can pause after every sentence,"},{"start":57,"text":"read it yourself,"},{"start":59,"text":"try to shadow my tone, and then play for"},{"start":64,"text":"the next sentence. Please click like"},{"start":68,"text":"to show your support. It keeps me"},{"start":72,"text":"motivated."},{"start":74,"text":"And also click subscribe so that we can"},{"start":78,"text":"be friends. My husband and I are going"},{"start":82,"text":"to explore Los Angeles and maybe take a"},{"start":88,"text":"walk around"},{"start":90,"text":"fancy neighborhoods here and look at the"},{"start":94,"text":"houses just for fun. We are also going"},{"start":99,"text":"to get a sandwich from my favorite"},{"start":103,"text":"sandwich shop."},{"start":105,"text":"If you have seen my previous videos, you"},{"start":108,"text":"would all know that it's called Bread"},{"start":111,"text":"Head and it is so delicious. I usually"},{"start":116,"text":"wear all black in my videos because I"},{"start":122,"text":"film right after I get off of work"},{"start":127,"text":"and it is the weekend."},{"start":129,"text":"It is sunny and I'm going out. So today"},{"start":133,"text":"I'm wearing a white linen button-down"},{"start":138,"text":"shirt. Button, not button. Nobody says"},{"start":142,"text":"button."},{"start":143,"text":"I'm also wearing"},{"start":145,"text":"some"},{"start":147,"text":"gold necklaces."},{"start":150,"text":"I'm wearing a I should probably stand up"},{"start":155,"text":"long dress. Can you see?"},{"start":159,"text":"It is a long dress."},{"start":161,"text":"And I am"},{"start":163,"text":"accessorizing"},{"start":165,"text":"with a purse that I got as a gift. Let"},{"start":171,"text":"me show you."},{"start":173,"text":"How beautiful is my new purse?"},{"start":177,"text":"It's a brand called"},{"start":180,"text":"Teddy Blake"},{"start":183,"text":"and it came from Italy."},{"start":186,"text":"Well,"},{"start":187,"text":"the"},{"start":188,"text":"factory is in Italy."},{"start":191,"text":"I already opened the purse because I was"},{"start":194,"text":"too excited."},{"start":197,"text":"But I love how the flap"},{"start":202,"text":"is extra secure with these"},{"start":207,"text":"buckles"},{"start":208,"text":"on the side."},{"start":210,"text":"These golden details"},{"start":214,"text":"make it look extra"},{"start":217,"text":"fancy."},{"start":219,"text":"I have to learn how to put this buckle"},{"start":222,"text":"on here with one hand."},{"start":225,"text":"Look at the details on the side."},{"start":228,"text":"I like how it scrunches."},{"start":231,"text":"Do you know what scrunch means? It means"},{"start":235,"text":"this, where the material"},{"start":238,"text":"gathers together."},{"start":241,"text":"And what's extra cool is"},{"start":245,"text":"it has this Italian"},{"start":248,"text":"tag. And I know that I have some Italian"},{"start":252,"text":"subscribers on here."},{"start":255,"text":"I will attempt to read this."},{"start":259,"text":"I don't know how to read Italian though."},{"start":262,"text":"See"},{"start":263,"text":"guarantee che"},{"start":266,"text":"l'origine"},{"start":267,"text":"la nita. Okay, I will stop. Sorry."},{"start":270,"text":"Sorry."},{"start":271,"text":"[laughter]"},{"start":273,"text":"Teddy Blake, this purse company,"},{"start":276,"text":"emailed me to tell me that they really"},{"start":280,"text":"like my channel."},{"start":283,"text":"And they"},{"start":285,"text":"sent me this purse as a gift. And it's"},{"start":290,"text":"actually my very first brand"},{"start":294,"text":"collaboration."},{"start":296,"text":"Did you know that"},{"start":298,"text":"when speaking English, a lot of people"},{"start":301,"text":"say collab instead of collaboration?"},{"start":306,"text":"Collaboration is a very long word."},{"start":310,"text":"When they emailed me,"},{"start":312,"text":"I was really surprised because"},{"start":315,"text":"I had never received a brand collab type"},{"start":320,"text":"of message from anyone. It came in this"},{"start":325,"text":"beautiful big box."},{"start":328,"text":"Oh, who is that?"},{"start":332,"text":"Comment below if you know who this is."},{"start":337,"text":"Boxes are his favorite toys."},{"start":340,"text":"I guess I am going to leave him in here"},{"start":344,"text":"while we go outside and explore LA. We"},{"start":349,"text":"are on the way to the sandwich shop."},{"start":354,"text":"And I'm bummed right now."},{"start":356,"text":"Bummed means"},{"start":358,"text":"not quite upset."},{"start":361,"text":"You're disappointed."},{"start":364,"text":"Just a little bit because I forgot my"},{"start":367,"text":"hat."},{"start":368,"text":"And this week at work"},{"start":372,"text":"I received a peel."},{"start":376,"text":"A peel means that the very top layer of"},{"start":380,"text":"your skin"},{"start":382,"text":"peels off."},{"start":384,"text":"So, it's important that I protect my"},{"start":388,"text":"face"},{"start":389,"text":"from the sun"},{"start":391,"text":"so that it doesn't become sensitive."},{"start":395,"text":"Today was a very productive day."},{"start":400,"text":"It is my day off"},{"start":402,"text":"which means I'm not working."},{"start":405,"text":"And"},{"start":407,"text":"I got up at"},{"start":407.6,"text":"a.m."},{"start":412,"text":"so that I was ready for a meeting"},{"start":417,"text":"with my business mentor"},{"start":421,"text":"at"},{"start":421.6,"text":"a.m."},{"start":423,"text":"I"},{"start":425,"text":"ate a light snack."},{"start":428,"text":"Do you know what a snack is?"},{"start":431,"text":"It is a"},{"start":433,"text":"light"},{"start":435,"text":"meal"},{"start":436,"text":"but not quite a meal. It's more like"},{"start":440,"text":"just a little bit of food to"},{"start":443,"text":"hold you over."},{"start":445,"text":"Hold you over means that it is"},{"start":449,"text":"sustaining you."},{"start":451,"text":"So, it wasn't a breakfast, just a snack."},{"start":457,"text":"And then I drank a little bit of coffee"},{"start":461,"text":"to give me some energy for my yoga"},{"start":465,"text":"class."},{"start":468,"text":"We made it to the sandwich shop."},{"start":472,"text":"And sometimes I think my husband is the"},{"start":475,"text":"parking fairy"},{"start":478,"text":"because he can find really good parking"},{"start":481,"text":"spots,"},{"start":483,"text":"especially when the shops out here are"},{"start":487,"text":"very busy."},{"start":489,"text":"We are walking towards the sandwich"},{"start":491,"text":"shop."},{"start":494,"text":"Because the weather is nice,"},{"start":497,"text":"many people are outside."},{"start":501,"text":"Here we are,"},{"start":503,"text":"Breadhead."},{"start":506,"text":"It smells"},{"start":508,"text":"really nice out here."},{"start":511,"text":"It smells like nature."},{"start":516,"text":"There's many different types of plants."},{"start":521,"text":"These type of plants are called"},{"start":524,"text":"succulents,"},{"start":526,"text":"and they don't require a lot of water."},{"start":531,"text":"Take a look at the houses around this"},{"start":535,"text":"neighborhood."},{"start":540,"text":"Which house do you like?"},{"start":547,"text":"They are all different styles of houses."},{"start":551,"text":"What do you call this plant in your"},{"start":554,"text":"native language?"},{"start":556,"text":"Let me know in the comments."},{"start":559,"text":"I am walking across the street"},{"start":564,"text":"to find some shade."},{"start":567,"text":"This is shade, where the sun is hiding."},{"start":574,"text":"This house over here with the fence."},{"start":579,"text":"Looks like a very traditional"},{"start":582,"text":"American style house."},{"start":585,"text":"This fence is called a white picket"},{"start":589,"text":"fence."},{"start":593,"text":"This house on the corner"},{"start":596,"text":"looks like"},{"start":599,"text":"a craftsman style house, I believe."},{"start":603,"text":"Which is a specific"},{"start":607,"text":"California"},{"start":608,"text":"style house."},{"start":611,"text":"This is a pine tree"},{"start":615,"text":"with many"},{"start":616,"text":"pine needles."},{"start":619,"text":"This is a pine needle."},{"start":622,"text":"Look at the crazy branches on this tree."},{"start":627,"text":"It looks like artwork."},{"start":631,"text":"I found"},{"start":633,"text":"the"},{"start":634,"text":"street with the most shade."},{"start":638,"text":"This style of tree is called a palm"},{"start":641,"text":"tree."},{"start":643,"text":"You may see trees like this in"},{"start":646,"text":"California,"},{"start":647,"text":"but also in Florida."},{"start":652,"text":"How interesting"},{"start":654,"text":"to have a"},{"start":656,"text":"yellow painted house."},{"start":661,"text":"The"},{"start":663,"text":"bushes and trees are too tall."},{"start":667,"text":"So I can't see the house."},{"start":672,"text":"This house"},{"start":673,"text":"is really nice."},{"start":676,"text":"It has a cool"},{"start":678,"text":"sculpture in the front."},{"start":682,"text":"It has wood,"},{"start":685,"text":"glass,"},{"start":686,"text":"concrete,"},{"start":689,"text":"stone."},{"start":693,"text":"What's this called?"},{"start":695,"text":"It's a swing."},{"start":698,"text":"We are"},{"start":700,"text":"heading home now."},{"start":702,"text":"When I get home,"},{"start":704,"text":"I'm going to continue working on my book"},{"start":708,"text":"and I'm going to edit this video."},{"start":712,"text":"Thank you for watching."},{"start":714,"text":"I will see you next time. Bye. Hello"},{"start":717,"text":"everyone. Welcome to a new episode of"},{"start":721,"text":"Bo's Slow English."},{"start":725,"text":"Today"},{"start":726,"text":"or tonight,"},{"start":728,"text":"I am going to my friend's house. It's"},{"start":732,"text":"about a 32-minute"},{"start":736,"text":"drive."},{"start":737,"text":"Behind me is my husband's jacket, in"},{"start":741,"text":"case you're wondering"},{"start":743,"text":"what that ghost is back there."},{"start":746,"text":"I am going to take you on a drive"},{"start":750,"text":"through LA. I'm going to turn my camera"},{"start":755,"text":"and I'm going to lift this"},{"start":759,"text":"visor."},{"start":760,"text":"Is this called a visor?"},{"start":762,"text":"Yep."},{"start":763,"text":"It is called a visor."},{"start":765,"text":"I had a brain fart. Do you know what"},{"start":768,"text":"that means?"},{"start":770,"text":"It means that I forgot."},{"start":774,"text":"Brain fart, that's a good one"},{"start":777,"text":"and a very funny term."},{"start":781,"text":"We're on a busy street"},{"start":784,"text":"called Wilshire Boulevard."},{"start":787,"text":"When I first moved here,"},{"start":789,"text":"I called 