with a lot of trees."},{"start":1058,"text":"This is a Spanish style home."},{"start":1063,"text":"The fire hydrants in Beverly Hills are"},{"start":1066,"text":"silver."},{"start":1069,"text":"We just crossed over"},{"start":1071,"text":"a"},{"start":1072,"text":"four-way"},{"start":1074,"text":"stop."},{"start":1076,"text":"Actually, is that what it's called?"},{"start":1079,"text":"Yes, a four-way stop, which means that"},{"start":1082,"text":"there are four stop signs"},{"start":1086,"text":"in this intersection. This is the famous"},{"start":1091,"text":"Rodeo Drive."},{"start":1094,"text":"If you go further south on Rodeo Drive,"},{"start":1098,"text":"that's where all the expensive"},{"start":1101,"text":"retail stores are."},{"start":1104,"text":"Look at the little dog that this person"},{"start":1107,"text":"is holding. How cute."},{"start":1110,"text":"We are approaching"},{"start":1113,"text":"a very weird intersection."},{"start":1116,"text":"I am surprised I've never witnessed an"},{"start":1120,"text":"accident on this intersection."},{"start":1124,"text":"It's like"},{"start":1126,"text":"five"},{"start":1128,"text":"intersections in one."},{"start":1131,"text":"Crazy."},{"start":1133,"text":"We are now"},{"start":1134,"text":"at the intersection"},{"start":1136,"text":"of"},{"start":1139,"text":"Sunset Boulevard."},{"start":1141,"text":"As you can see,"},{"start":1143,"text":"it's a lot busier."},{"start":1146,"text":"Over here"},{"start":1147,"text":"is"},{"start":1149,"text":"the Beverly Hills Hotel."},{"start":1152,"text":"I have been there once before"},{"start":1156,"text":"when I used to be"},{"start":1159,"text":"a hair stylist."},{"start":1161,"text":"I cut"},{"start":1162,"text":"a client's hair"},{"start":1164,"text":"in one of the suites."},{"start":1169,"text":"The reason why"},{"start":1172,"text":"we are going to"},{"start":1174,"text":"our friend's house tonight"},{"start":1177,"text":"is because"},{"start":1179,"text":"he invited us over"},{"start":1182,"text":"to eat homemade"},{"start":1185,"text":"pho."},{"start":1187,"text":"Do you know what pho is?"},{"start":1191,"text":"It is a"},{"start":1192,"text":"popular Vietnamese"},{"start":1196,"text":"dish."},{"start":1198,"text":"It has soup,"},{"start":1201,"text":"some protein,"},{"start":1203,"text":"maybe chicken,"},{"start":1204,"text":"maybe"},{"start":1206,"text":"bean sprouts,"},{"start":1208,"text":"noodles,"},{"start":1211,"text":"a squeeze of lime."},{"start":1214,"text":"What am I missing?"},{"start":1216,"text":"Some chili peppers."},{"start":1218,"text":"This neighborhood is kind of crazy,"},{"start":1221,"text":"isn't it?"},{"start":1222,"text":"Oh, look at this park."},{"start":1225,"text":"I've never been to this park before."},{"start":1229,"text":"That's next to this beautiful fire"},{"start":1231,"text":"station."},{"start":1233,"text":"Look at the houses up on the hill."},{"start":1236,"text":"This house is for sale."},{"start":1240,"text":"I wish we could see"},{"start":1242,"text":"what the house looks like."},{"start":1245,"text":"I used to go"},{"start":1247,"text":"to open houses for fun."},{"start":1250,"text":"Do you know what an open house is?"},{"start":1254,"text":"It's when"},{"start":1257,"text":"the realtor,"},{"start":1259,"text":"who is the person"},{"start":1262,"text":"that's selling the house, opens the"},{"start":1264,"text":"house"},{"start":1266,"text":"for the public to come in"},{"start":1269,"text":"to check it out."},{"start":1271,"text":"Check it out means to look"},{"start":1276,"text":"in hopes of"},{"start":1279,"text":"finding prospective buyers."},{"start":1283,"text":"We are on Coldwater"},{"start":1286,"text":"Canyon Drive."},{"start":1290,"text":"And we are approaching Mulholland Drive."},{"start":1298,"text":"If you look at the"},{"start":1300,"text":"light gray on the side of"},{"start":1305,"text":"the purple"},{"start":1306,"text":"you can see that there are a lot of"},{"start":1310,"tex