":1442,"text":"getting higher up in elevation."},{"start":1446,"text":"This road is very windy."},{"start":1452,"text":"You will see in the caption"},{"start":1455,"text":"that the word"},{"start":1456,"text":"looks like it should be pronounced"},{"start":1460,"text":"windy."},{"start":1461,"text":"But in this context, it's windy."},{"start":1466,"text":"These are cute houses."},{"start":1469,"text":"This neighborhood is called Laurel"},{"start":1471,"text":"Hills."},{"start":1473,"text":"Actually, people in California will"},{"start":1476,"text":"probably pronounce it as Laurel Hills."},{"start":1482,"text":"And it looks like he lives in Laurel"},{"start":1485,"text":"Hills."},{"start":1487,"text":"And now we are making our way down the"},{"start":1490,"text":"canyon."},{"start":1492,"text":"This is a lovely neighborhood."},{"start":1495,"text":"Quiet."},{"start":1497,"text":"Lots of trees."},{"start":1500,"text":"A lot of these houses are"},{"start":1503,"text":"modern style."},{"start":1508,"text":"This"},{"start":1509,"text":"may have been a modern style house,"},{"start":1513,"text":"but it looks like"},{"start":1515,"text":"many of these houses are"},{"start":1518,"text":"renovated."},{"start":1519,"text":"Renovated means"},{"start":1523,"text":"redone"},{"start":1525,"text":"or updated."},{"start":1529,"text":"This road is dangerous to drive on"},{"start":1532,"text":"because it's extremely narrow."},{"start":1535,"text":"So, we need to really be careful"},{"start":1539,"text":"of the oncoming traffic."},{"start":1544,"text":"Okay, now we are going back up the hill"},{"start":1549,"text":"and I think we're"},{"start":1552,"text":"here."},{"start":1553,"text":"Wow, it's super tight."},{"start":1557,"text":"Oh."},{"start":1558,"text":"So, this is kind of a cul-de-sac"},{"start":1562,"text":"like I mentioned earlier"},{"start":1564,"text":"because it dead ends."},{"start":1568,"text":"This is not his house."},{"start":1572,"text":"No."},{"start":1573,"text":"My 